LOCAL database, its tests pass, it is additive/backward compatible with the hosted pre-Phase-4 build and the Phase 4 
build (§10), and its rollback SQL is recorded in the migration header and TRACK. Each one gets a row in 
`spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/MIGRATIONS-PENDENTES.md`. Nothing is applied online before T23.
