request charges surviving rollback, and malformed/early-validation/failure tests. T6 also tests limiter failure. |
| R3 — T8 requires later recovery | **Resolved** | AC-040 leaves T8 and belongs to T27, which follows T8. |
| R4 — Ten-message deadline | **Resolved** | T8’s `Done when` requires ten messages within ten seconds. T10 expressly 
covers attempts started before **or during** the outage. |
